---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="About | Cocktails Guru"
    description="What Cocktails Guru is, and why it exists."
>
    <section class="prose mb-6 max-w-2xl md:mb-8">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground">About</p>
        <h1 class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-4xl">
            About Cocktails Guru
        </h1>
    </section>

    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/90 md:text-base">
        <p>
            Cocktails Guru is a small, curated catalogue of cocktail recipes
            built for home mixing. The goal is a fast, ad-free reference you
            can pull up at the bar — no autoplay videos, no life story above
            every recipe.
        </p>

        <p>
            Every recipe lists ingredients with measurements in oz or ml,
            scales for 1× to 4× servings, and works offline once visited.
            Lists you build stay on your device.
        </p>

        <p>
            The project is open source. The source, content, and image
            licences are available on
            <a
                href="https://github.com/KiraLT/cocktails-guru"
                rel="nofollow noopener"
                target="_blank"
                class="text-primary hover:underline"
            >GitHub</a>.
        </p>

        <p>
            If a recipe is wrong, missing, or you have a classic that belongs
            in the catalogue, open an issue or pull request.
        </p>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
